   "lines": [
    "Have been look-",
    "ing over my",
    "Egyptian journal;",
    "every incident",
    "is connected with",
    "him.",
    "Sometimes when",
    "I think of my",
    "terrible loss it",
    "seems as if my",
    "heart would",
    "break; he shared",
    "all my joys,",
    "and in sharing",
    "doubled them,",
    "and soothed all",
    "the few sorrows",
    "I ever had."
   ],
   "rows": null,
   "columns": null,
   "confidence": "high",
   "note": "\"him\" is underlined."
  }
